OL,3,ARussell Brand asked assistant for
OL,4,Afemale fan phone numbers, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former personal assistant of Russell
OL,7,FBrand has told a court she was
OL,8,Finstructed to get phone numbers for the
OL,9,Fentertainer from female fans when she
OL,10,Ffirst started working with him.
OL,12,FHelen Berger, who worked closely with
OL,13,FBrand from June 2006 to February 2007,
OL,14,Fsaid the request "felt uncomfortable"
OL,15,Fand, after seeking advice, she told the
OL,16,FTV personality that she would not do
OL,17,Fthat anymore.
OL,19,FBrand, 51, is accused of three counts
OL,20,Fof rape, three counts of sexual
OL,21,Fassault, and one charge of indecent
OL,22,Fassault.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
